WEBVTT

00:16:58.787 --> 00:17:02.121
you may be truly mindful
of what you do have.

00:17:02.162 --> 00:17:05.663
And if the gods are kind,
you may truly enjoy what you have.

00:17:05.996 --> 00:17:08.204
That is the one singular gift
you may receive

00:17:08.204 --> 00:17:10.996
if you suffer in any existential way.

00:17:10.996 --> 00:17:12.204
You know death,

00:17:12.246 --> 00:17:15.371
and so may wake each morning
pulsing with ruddy life.

00:17:15.413 --> 00:17:17.163
Some part of you is cold,

00:17:17.204 --> 00:17:20.829
and so another part may truly enjoy
what it is to be warm,

00:17:20.871 --> 00:17:22.704
or even to be cold.

00:17:23.496 --> 00:17:25.413
When one morning, years after the crash,

00:17:25.454 --> 00:17:26.788
I stepped onto stone

00:17:26.829 --> 00:17:29.704
and the underside of my left foot
felt the flash of cold,

00:17:29.704 --> 00:17:32.038
nerves at last awake,